Description: Implements EKIO's visual identity for data visualization with
    'ggplot2'. Supplies a coordinated theme, color palettes, discrete and
    continuous scales, and helpers for accessible text contrast. Includes
    high-level recipes for common charts so analysts can create consistent,
    publication-ready graphics with concise code.
